:name: R4 / Experiment 4 - minimal Arduino-ESP32 sketch on the ESP32-S2 platform
:description: Loads firmware/probes/build/r4-arduino-min.elf (built by
:description: firmware/probes/build-r4-arduino.mjs with F3's pinned s2mini profile)
:description: onto the checked-in esp32s2-sesame platform and runs it.
:description:
:description: No boot ROM and no second-stage bootloader: LoadELF places every
:description: PT_LOAD segment directly and the ELF entry point (call_start_cpu0) is
:description: used, so execution starts where the bootloader would have jumped.
:description:
:description: Run through the timeout guard, never bare:
:description:   node emulator/renode/tests/r4-run.mjs emulator/renode/scripts/r4-arduino-min.resc r4-exp4-arduino 90

using sysbus

mach create "r4-arduino"
machine LoadPlatformDescription @emulator/renode/platforms/esp32s2-sesame.repl

logLevel 1
sysbus LoadELF @firmware/probes/build/r4-arduino-min.elf

echo ""
echo "### entry PC"
cpu PC

emulation RunFor "0.05"

echo ""
echo "### final PC"
cpu PC
echo "### executed instructions"
cpu ExecutedInstructions

quit
